        "source_level": "B2",
        "word_count": 500,
        "duration_sec": null,
        "body_text": "The Democratic Republic of Congo military says it is searching for one of its aircraft, after rebels said they had shot down a warplane in the east. The military said it had lost contact with a small Cessna 208 cargo plane on Sunday following \"poor weather conditions\". The fate of the plane and its crew remained uncertain, it added.",
